1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,487
A lead comes in at two a.m.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,008
The form hits a webhook.

3
00:00:06,900 --> 00:00:09,255
Enriched, deduped, and routed.

4
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,616
The right rep owns it before nine.

5
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,600
The CRM updates itself.

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,952
A digest lands in your inbox at seven.

7
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,805
New leads, what moved, what stalled.

8
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:24,513
You read it and press approve.

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,592
That is the whole morning stand-up.

10
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:30,808
No one typing. Nothing stale.

11
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:34,200
Book a fit call.

12
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,313
